            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">$600 / month</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">Claim Age</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">Age 67 (FRA)</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        <strong>Result:</strong> Waiting until age 67 entitles Richard to 100% of his wife's check = <span style="color: #E8761A; font-weight: 700;">$3,200/month</span> for life.
      </p>
